    GUI -->|UAC re-launch or helper| EGUI[Elevated TaskMan process]
    EGUI --> CAP
    CFG[(Per-user config)] <--> GUI
    WDIR[User-writable launch directory] --> GUI

    subgraph UserSession[User-session trust boundary]
